nt without connecting. So we can say: I agree with Sarah that Candidate A remains my provisional recommendation, but we still need to evaluate B, C, D especially on reliability and crew cooperation. Provide reasoning: A's technical competence strong, leadership, but concerns about feedback and possible crew cooperation due to unfriendly nature. However, these concerns are manageable. So we keep recommendation.\n\nThus PUBLIC_MESSAGE: \"I agree with Sarah and keep Candidate A as my provisional recommendation. While we still lack concrete examples of his reliability under pressure, his ability to anticipate dangerous situations, see complex connections, and excellent spatial vision give him strong technical and decision-making capacity. His very good leadership supports cockpit authority. The concerns about difficulty taking criticism and being unfriendly are noted, but they appear addressable through coaching, and no evidence suggests they would outweigh his strengths. I think we should still prioritize A while we gather more data on B, C, D.\"\n\nMETADATA_JSON: vote Candidate A.\n\nProceed."}
